{"availability":"available","full":"henry-luo/lambda","name":"lambda","description":"A modern, general-purpose, pure functional programming language (Alpha)","category":"Productivity","language":"C","stars":15,"forks":0,"created":"2025-07-09T04:45:01Z","updated":"2026-10-19T03:30:30Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://henry-luo.github.io/lambda/","topics":["doc-engine","functional-programming","markdown","query-language","reactiveui","schema","template-engine","type-first","validate"],"demo":"https://henry-luo.github.io/lambda/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:54.739Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:54.739Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:54.739Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:39:09.357Z","stars":15,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T23:50:59.014Z","stars":15,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:21.731Z","stars":15,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T19:18:49.140Z","stars":15,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T06:19:54.739Z","stars":15,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A general-purpose, cross-platform, functional scripting language and document processing engine in a single 20 MB executable, built from scratch in C/C++.","Internally, Lambda treats documents as structured data. Different input formats (Markdown, Wiki, HTML/XML, JSON/YAML/TOML/CSV, LaTeX, PDF, …) are parsed into a unified Lambda/Mark node tree, transformed with Lambda scripts, validated with schemas, and then rendered via the Radiant HTML/CSS/SVG/JS layout engine.","A stable subset of the literal data model is separately formalised and released as Mark Notation."],"features":["an expressive functional language for transforming data and documents, and","an end-to-end document pipeline (parse → validate/transform → layout → render/view).","Lambda script (pure functional runtime)","Pure-functional core with immutable data structures (arrays, maps, elements) and first-class functions and types.","Expressive pipe operator (|>, with the filter stage |:) for fluent set-oriented data transformation pipelines with inline mapping and filtering."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/henry-luo/lambda/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"8b4d322bae98f028dbd68aca9a6cd0ab89f1d9a390241a7677707cd60fe8099c","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T19:18:49.279Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:54.873Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A general-purpose, cross-platform, functional scripting language and document processing engine in a single 20 MB executable, built from scratch in C/C++.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/henry-luo/lambda/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8b4d322bae98f028dbd68aca9a6cd0ab89f1d9a390241a7677707cd60fe8099c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/henry-luo/lambda/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:54.873Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-19T03:30:30Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/henry-luo/lambda/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:54.874Z","hash":"8b4d322bae98f028dbd68aca9a6cd0ab89f1d9a390241a7677707cd60fe8099c","originalBytes":16913,"storedBytes":16913,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:19:54.739Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Productivity","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Apple","Templates & UI components","Maths & algorithms"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://henry-luo.github.io/lambda/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T06:36:47.844Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T06:36:47.844Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-19T06:36:47.844Z","target":"https://henry-luo.github.io/lambda/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-26T06:36:47.844Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T06:36:47.844Z","previewCheck":